# The showroom's browsable pages are the compiler's own output, generated by the `showroom-docs`
# target. The Docs workflow builds dsdlc and produces them at publish time, so they are not committed
# -- generate them locally before previewing the site, or mkdocs will fail on the nav entry.
docs/showroom/
.venv-docs/

# Reference DSDL compiler checkouts for the differential parity lane (CI clones
# these; local runs may too). Provisioned, never committed.
.reference/

